OL,3,GNEWSAHouse clearance Patek Philippe
OL,4,Awatch sells for #59k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "extremely rare" watch which was
OL,7,Ffound tucked away in a deceased
OL,8,Fmother's jewellery box has fetched
OL,9,F#59,000 at auction.
OL,11,FThe 1930s Patek Philippe wristwatch was
OL,12,Fdiscovered amongst items of jewellery
OL,13,Fat a house in Camborne, Cornwall during
OL,14,Fa house clearance.
OL,16,FThe watch was taken to Hansons
OL,17,FAuctioneers who estimated it was worth
OL,18,Fbetween #5,000-#10,000, but the item
OL,19,Freceived bids from across the world and
OL,20,Fwent for nearly 12 times the lower
OL,21,Fguide price to a buyer from Hong Kong.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
